### The README.md and the PM report

The README.md quotes the PM order of D1 word for word from the spec, the owner words of D2 word for
word from owner-look1.json, and the 2 spend lines word for word from spend-log.tsv. The script
reads those 3 texts from their source files, so no text was typed by hand. The README holds the
old and new SHA-256 values of the T-shirt files, the judge result of each try, the print gate, the
spend, and the 6 unchanged folders. It ends with the text "The judge results of the t-shirt are
model evidence, not acceptance. Daniel's look gate and the Workbooks checks decide."

The pm-report.md starts with `Status: done.` and holds the folder path, the MANIFEST.txt SHA-256,
the OK count, the 2 spend lines, the judge results of each try, the words of D2, the old and new
SHA-256 values of the T-shirt, the 6 unchanged folders, and the Facts changed list. No other
sentence of either file says that Daniel, the PM, or Workbooks accepted a picture.

